  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/infrastructure.html#the-domstringlist-interface\r\n\r\n> The length attribute's getter must this DOMStringList object's associated list's size\r\n\r\nmissed a single word **return**:\r\n\r\nThe length attribute's getter must **return** this DOMStringList object's associated list's size\r\n\r\nAnd in the next paragraph:\r\n\r\n> The item(index) method, when invoked, must return the indexth item in this DOMStringList object's associated list, or null if index plus one is less than this DOMStringList object's associated list's size.\r\n\r\nI believe it means:\r\n\r\nThe item(index) method, when invoked, must return the indexth item in this DOMStringList object's associated list, or null if index plus one is **greater** than this DOMStringList object's associated list's size.",
